#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:10002
#: 3f63a132e365469796a10be83ecb5077
msgid "Calibration Transfer Function and Physical Units Contract"
msgstr "校正伝達関数と物理単位契約"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:10004
#: 370eabf540fb4e798ae60203df63cbc4
msgid ""
"This tutorial demonstrates rigorous application of frequency-dependent "
"calibration transfer functions $C(f) = Y(f) / X(f)$ with unit `count / m`, "
"converting raw digital counts into physical displacement meters "
"$[\\mathrm{m}]$ and differential arm strain $[1 / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$."
msgstr ""
"このチュートリアルでは、単位 `count / m` を持つ周波数依存の校正伝達関数 $C(f) = Y(f) / X(f)$ "
"を厳密に適用し、生のデジタルカウントを物理変位メートル $[\\mathrm{m}]$ および差動アームひずみ $[1 / "
"\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$ へ変換する手法を実証します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:10006
#: 46b0fc26b3b846c4af612594e6f5e4d8
msgid "Scientific and Computational Objectives"
msgstr "科学的および計算上の目標"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:10007
#: 668e8121efcd40f28cbb80ae3246c47a
msgid ""
"**Physical I/O Contract**: Define frequency response $C(f)$ [count / m] and "
"apply the inverse calibration $X(f) = Y(f) / C(f)$ to recover physical "
"displacement."
msgstr ""
"**物理入出力規約**: 周波数応答 $C(f)$ [count / m] を定義し、逆校正 $X(f) = Y(f) / C(f)$ "
"を適用して物理変位を復元します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:10008
#: 413492c767d9465186e893377fb0dbe3
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"**Harmonic Tone Recovery**: Inject 3 discrete calibration lines (40 Hz, 80 "
"Hz, 120 Hz) and verify $<2\\%$ amplitude recovery and $<10^{-6}$ rad phase "
"consistency."
msgstr ""
"**高調波トーン信号の復元**: 3つの離散校正ライン（40 Hz, 80 Hz, 120 Hz）を注入し、振幅復元誤差 $<2\\%$ および位相整合性"
" $<10^{-6}$ rad を確認します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:10009
#: 91672f2990864e3396a09f4c954a82d0
msgid ""
"**ASD & PSD Dimensional Consistency**: Verify that displacement ASD has unit "
"$[\\mathrm{m} / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$ and PSD has unit $[\\mathrm{m}^2 / "
"\\mathrm{Hz}]$, and compute arm strain sensitivity $h(f) = X(f) / L$ ($L = "
"3000\\,\\mathrm{m}$)."
msgstr ""
"**ASD・PSD 次元整合性**: 変位 ASD の単位が $[\\mathrm{m} / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$、PSD "
"の単位が $[\\mathrm{m}^2 / \\mathrm{Hz}]$ であることを検証し、アームひずみ感度 $h(f) = X(f) / L$（$L"
" = 3000\\,\\mathrm{m}$）を算出します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:10010
#: 3c2fc6d2869244669b2e7b8a7423650b
msgid ""
"**Defensive Validation**: Catch wrong-direction conversions via Astropy "
"`UnitConversionError`, catch frequency-grid mismatches, and handle zero-"
"response DC singularities safely."
msgstr ""
"**防御的検証**: Astropy の `UnitConversionError` "
"による逆方向変換の検出、周波数グリッド不一致の検出、およびDC特異点（ゼロ応答）の安全な除外を実証します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:20002
#: 7b9269a152884d3884a3c901188cc5c8
msgid "Environment Setup"
msgstr "環境のセットアップ"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:40002
#: cee0b160b89f476894e4d7ab8ef9d433
msgid "1. Physical Signal and Calibration Model"
msgstr "1. 物理信号と校正モデル"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:40004
#: 62f9734a3894406b80ca9dc24cc7c55b
msgid ""
"We simulate a physical displacement signal $x_{\\mathrm{phys}}(t)$ [m] "
"containing three calibrated sinusoidal injection lines and broadband "
"background displacement noise."
msgstr "3本の校正用正弦波注入ラインと広帯域背景変位ノイズを含む物理変位信号 $x_{\\mathrm{phys}}(t)$ [m] をシミュレーションします。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:40006
#: 06f2335e5f7e4b2c9edd17fe419a65ce
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The instrument readout introduces a frequency-dependent transfer function "
"$C(f)$ [count / m] with DC gain $G = 1.0 \\times 10^9\\,\\mathrm{ct/m}$, "
"high-frequency roll-off pole at $f_p = 300\\,\\mathrm{Hz}$, zero at $f_z = "
"30\\,\\mathrm{Hz}$, and fixed pipeline delay $\\tau = 4 / f_s\\,\\mathrm{s}$."
msgstr ""
"測定器の読み出し系は、DCゲイン $G = 1.0 \\times 10^9\\,\\mathrm{ct/m}$、高周波ロールオフ極 $f_p = "
"300\\,\\mathrm{Hz}$、零点 $f_z = 30\\,\\mathrm{Hz}$、および固定パイプライン遅延 $\\tau = 4 / "
"f_s\\,\\mathrm{s}$ を持つ周波数依存の伝達関数 $C(f)$ [count / m] を導入します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:60002
#: 05073c4de2b343b8bc2be74f667a26d9
msgid "2. Calibration Recovery and Harmonic Line Verification"
msgstr "2. 校正復元と調和線の検証"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:60004
#: 817e6ccc96a44bcba22b473c30e79cbc
msgid ""
"To calibrate from raw counts $Y(f)$ back to displacement $X(f)$, we divide by"
" the complex response: $$X_{\\mathrm{cal}}(f) = \\frac{Y(f)}{C(f)}$$ "
"Dimensional consistency dictates: $$\\frac{\\mathrm{ct}}{\\mathrm{ct} / "
"\\mathrm{m}} = \\mathrm{m}$$"
msgstr ""
"生のカウント $Y(f)$ から変位 $X(f)$ を復元校正するために、複素応答で除算します： $$X_{\\mathrm{cal}}(f) = "
"\\frac{Y(f)}{C(f)}$$ 次元の整合性より次が成り立ちます： $$\\frac{\\mathrm{ct}}{\\mathrm{ct} / "
"\\mathrm{m}} = \\mathrm{m}$$"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:60009
#: 1c2565d222ff42fcbf3cc8c263fc9a21
msgid "We verify amplitude and phase recovery at the three injected line frequencies."
msgstr "注入された3つのライン周波数において、振幅および位相の復元精度を検証します。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:80002
#: cf491aeda5c140f696b5d400984e5c15
msgid "3. Defensive Unit & Grid Consistency Guards"
msgstr "3. 防御的単位・グリッド整合性ガード"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:80004
#: ccf5c39f04a74cde86fef74b61b36ee9
msgid "We verify essential safety checks:"
msgstr "以下の必須の安全性チェックを検証します："

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:80005
#: 091df2c72cee46df81303a8dcace5c13
msgid ""
"**Wrong-direction guard**: Multiplying $Y \\cdot C$ or attempting "
"`raw_counts.to(u.m)` without calibration must raise `UnitConversionError`."
msgstr ""
"**逆方向変換ガード**: $Y \\cdot C$ の乗算や校正なしの `raw_counts.to(u.m)` は "
"`UnitConversionError` を発生させる必要があります。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:80006
#: 0708824ee63347f3b332a92e41f1078c
msgid ""
"**Frequency grid mismatch guard**: Incompatible frequency vectors (different "
"$\\Delta f$ or lengths) must be detected before division."
msgstr "**周波数グリッド不一致ガード**: 互換性のない周波数ベクトル（異なる $\\Delta f$ や長さ）は除算前に検出される必要があります。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:80007
#: f6155cd2ba7047bca3c14370cd472404
msgid ""
"**Zero-response DC singularity guard**: Zero response at DC or nodes must be "
"safely masked and excluded without artificial small values."
msgstr "**ゼロ応答DC特異点ガード**: DCやノードでのゼロ応答は、人工的な微小値に置き換えることなく安全にマスク・除外される必要があります。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:100002
#: c532d41417cd4048bebb166adb95b634
msgid "4. Spectral Densities (ASD, PSD) and Strain Sensitivity"
msgstr "4. スペクトル密度（ASD, PSD）とひずみ感度"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:100004
#: 1daf38f9a40540c0b0bde4513478118c
msgid ""
"We compute the Amplitude Spectral Density (ASD) and Power Spectral Density "
"(PSD) of calibrated displacement, and convert to differential arm strain "
"$h(f) = X(f) / L$ with detector arm length $L = 3000\\,\\mathrm{m}$: $$A_x(f)"
" = \\frac{A_y(f)}{|C(f)|} \\quad [\\mathrm{m} / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$$ "
"$$P_x(f) = \\frac{P_y(f)}{|C(f)|^2} = A_x(f)^2 \\quad [\\mathrm{m}^2 / "
"\\mathrm{Hz}]$$ $$h(f) = \\frac{A_x(f)}{L} \\quad [1 / "
"\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$$"
msgstr ""
"校正済み変位の振幅スペクトル密度（ASD）およびパワースペクトル密度（PSD）を算出し、検出器アーム長 $L = 3000\\,\\mathrm{m}$ "
"を用いて差動アームひずみ $h(f) = X(f) / L$ に変換します：\n"
"$$A_x(f) = \\frac{A_y(f)}{|C(f)|} \\quad [\\mathrm{m} / "
"\\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$$\n"
"$$P_x(f) = \\frac{P_y(f)}{|C(f)|^2} = A_x(f)^2 \\quad [\\mathrm{m}^2 / "
"\\mathrm{Hz}]$$\n"
"$$h(f) = \\frac{A_x(f)}{L} \\quad [1 / \\sqrt{\\mathrm{Hz}}]$$"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:120002
#: c6eb02f2007a468582f0452950a742c0
msgid "5. Visual Diagnostics and Artifact Generation"
msgstr "5. 診断可視化と成果物生成"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:120004
#: 8b82ac0f249640a19508d53ac8c8663e
msgid "We generate three required diagnostic figures and display them inline:"
msgstr "3つの必須診断図面を生成し、インライン表示します："

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:120005
#: e6cf7cf9fce04506a6d5baaba2ee5d4b
msgid "`calibration_response.png`: Bode magnitude and phase response of $C(f)$."
msgstr "`calibration_response.png`: $C(f)$ のボード振幅・位相応答。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:120006
#: 8deba65fa6694573b0142d27464b32f6
msgid ""
"`spectrum_calibration.png`: Complex spectrum recovery showing raw counts vs "
"calibrated displacement."
msgstr "`spectrum_calibration.png`: 生カウントと校正済み変位を示す複素スペクトル復元。"

#: ../../../home/washimi/work/gwexpy-worktrees/docs-remediation-20260916/docs_redesign/how-to/calibration/calibration_units_contract.ipynb:120007
#: 7718f30b1349484081696f2fe62e2ea9
msgid ""
"`asd_psd_comparison.png`: Calibrated displacement ASD and corresponding "
"strain sensitivity."
msgstr "`asd_psd_comparison.png`: 校正済み変位 ASD および対応するひずみ感度。"

